# Data assets must stay LF on every platform. On a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true, an unspecified text file is rewritten to CRLF, which
# leaves a trailing \r on the last TSV column (the tz) and breaks the timezone
# lookup once the asset is bundled (swe-dashboard/119). Pin them to LF.
*.tsv text eol=lf
assets/atlas/** text eol=lf
